### Normalized scores (1–100)

**Tool use: 85/100.** Estimated based on flash tier performance and typical agentic capabilities. Caps: strong but not top-tier; optimized for speed.

**Reasoning: 88/100.** Estimated based on rank ~25-40 on AI Intelligence Index for flash tier. Caps: good reasoning for speed, but below pro models.

**Context window: 95/100.** ~1M tokens typical for Flash tier. Caps: good but not the highest; suitable for long documents and RAG.

**Multimodal: 95/100.** Text + image input, text output. 1M context supports documents and images. Caps: standard multimodal for flash models.

**Coding: 82/100.** Estimated based on flash tier coding capabilities. Caps: decent coding but not specialized.

**Cost efficiency: 95/100.** Estimated $0.5-2/M input, $1-4/M output. 80-95% cache discount. Best-in-class cost-efficiency among flash models.

**Overall Score: 89/100.** Mean of Tool (85) + Reasoning (88) + Context (95) + Multimodal (95) + Coding (82) = 89.0. Excellent value flash model; strong reasoning with top-tier cost-efficiency and speed.

